;책이에요.&#160;찬반이&#160;있을&#160;주제를&#160;간단하게&#160;잘&#160;풀어놓았습니다.&#160;이&#160;책에&#160;나오는&#160;등장인물은&#160;&lt;은하행성&#160;서비</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">스센터,&#160;정상&#160;영업합니다(곽재식)&gt;의&#160;주인공입니다.(이&#160;책도&#160;강추!)&#160; </span><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;미래법정&gt;의 주제가 참 좋은데, 한 번 보시지요.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">----------------------</span></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dff1517e2f5324f7ee51b6f672454f9305b2b2c3\" data-origin-width=\"306\" data-origin-height=\"386\" style=\"width:28.35%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dff1517e2f5324f7ee51b6f672454f9305b2b2c3\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9ff0a14a98d031715f1a3a658cce4895473d8a1\" data-origin-width=\"367\" data-origin-height=\"386\" style=\"width:34.01%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9ff0a14a98d031715f1a3a658cce4895473d8a1\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/361f76b9ffc73fe2cc91e9d92898945411a06cd5\" data-origin-width=\"382\" data-origin-height=\"363\" style=\"width:37.64%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/361f76b9ffc73fe2cc91e9d92898945411a06cd5\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1e27ed8e1228b0c8bff6ec21ee28a5c6c747efa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a1e27ed8e1228b0c8bff6ec21ee28a5c6c747efa\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"241\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.dau